cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the repository and the associated conference paper."
title: "MATLAB Implementation and Input Data for the Comparative Assessment of ELCC, ECP, and Firm Capacity Methodologies (IEEE ETCM 2026, Paper ID 119)"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation and input datasets supporting the paper "Comparative
  Assessment of ELCC, ECP, and Firm Capacity Methodologies for Resource
  Adequacy in Renewable-Dominated Power Systems". The repository contains the
  probabilistic-deterministic adequacy framework based on exact recursive
  Capacity Outage Probability Table (COPT) convolution and 8760-hour
  chronological Loss of Load Expectation (LOLE) evaluation, applied to a
  24-hour illustrative case and to the Ecuador National Interconnected System
  (SNI) 2025.
